BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpCanon"] = "A canon, like Frère Jacques, but on a new theme. Each voice enters one bar after the previous one. While a voice waits for its entry, and after it finishes, it tolls a bell: a half rest followed by C4. Record the theme as a procedure and call it from all four start blocks. Three or more voices should use different instruments.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpCallResponse"] = "A conversation between four instruments. Put your four start blocks in order - trumpet (call), violin (answer), banjo (chatter) and piano (bass) - each looping its own short phrase. Every voice uses a different rhythm: quarters and halves, slow halves down low, and quick eighth notes. Use at least three different instruments, then let the parts trade calls and responses.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpRound"] = "A two-voice round. The second voice waits two beats, then plays the same eight notes as the first. Use a procedure so the tune is written once.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpWaltz"] = "A waltz in three-four time: three voices play a melody, a bass line on C and G, and a chord pattern. Repeat short patterns with loops.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpChase"] = "A chase in eighth notes: three voices play the same rising phrase, each starting half a beat after the previous one.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpSyncopation"] = "Syncopation: put the melody on the off-beats with quarter rests, while the bass and chord voices keep a steady pulse.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpArpeggio"] = "An arpeggio study for four voices: broken chords ripple upward while the lower voices hold the harmony.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpLullaby"] = "A lullaby for three voices: a gentle melody with rests, a rocking bass, and a soft harmony. Keep every note half a beat long.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpRoundThree"] = "A three-voice round: voices enter one beat apart and play the same eight-note phrase.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpFanfare"] = "A fanfare for four voices: a bright repeated call, a harmony a third below, a steady bass, and an echo of the call one beat later.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpText10"] = "Compose anything you want. You've got a huge number of new blocks you can explore. Have fun!";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Music.helpText10Reddit"] = "Use the 'See Gallery' button to see what other people have composed. If you compose something interesting, use the 'Submit to Gallery' button to publish it.";  // untranslated
