BlocklyGamesMsg["Pond.helpPatrol"] = "This opponent patrols along your row.  A cannon shot takes time to fly, so aiming at where the enemy is now lands behind it.  Use 'scan' to measure the distance, close in, then fire with that distance as the range.  On the last level the enemy fires back - don't just sit there.";  // untranslated
BlocklyGamesMsg["Pond.helpAdvanced"] = "A harder battle: several enemies at once. Read the battlefield, keep moving so you are not an easy target, and use 'scan', 'swim' and 'cannon' together. Some enemies shoot back.";  // untranslated
